    ["有什么东西在你的皮肤下燃烧，把你从内到外染成猩红的月色。 你的力量远超常人，那些想要束缚你的枷锁，在你眼中不过是笑话。 可你的人性也在逐渐流失，你的认知开始错乱，无法感知到敌友的区别。 你的非凡之力在涌动，却不停你的命令。 你的躯体在发出暗红的光，就像一根即将烧断的引线。你已在危险的边缘，下一步，就是深渊。\n——伤害中幅提升；免疫大部分控制；受到伤害提升；释放技能时有概率误伤队友；画面错乱概率提升；自身发出红色光效"] = "Something is burning under your skin, dyeing you from the inside out in the color of scarlet moonlight. Your strength far exceeds that of ordinary people; those shackles that seek to bind you are nothing but a joke in your eyes. But your humanity is also gradually slipping away, your cognition is beginning to disorder, and you cannot perceive the difference between friend and foe. Your Beyonder power is surging, but it does not obey your commands. Your body is emitting a dark red light, like a fuse about to burn out. You are already on the edge of danger; the next step is the abyss. \n— Damage moderately increased; immune to most control; damage taken increased; probability of friendly fire when using skills; probability of visual distortion increased; self emits red light effect",
